ner: @thesahindia</details>\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022031119289878700840</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2031119289878700840</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-03-16</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/84639/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/84639/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/95463","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/95463/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/95463/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/95463/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/95463","id":4825622200,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABH6EmuA","number":95463,"title":"Entire system message is copied when part of message is selected and copied to clipboard","user":{"login":"applause-bot[bot]","id":265651874,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOD9WGog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/3009811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/applause-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/applause-bot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github