xpensify/App/pull/92142\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** sdjoisndjosjoisjdoj@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** Mac 26.5 / Chrome\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Go to staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Go to workspace chat.\n3. Create an expense.\n4. Open the report.\n5. Click Submit, Approve and Mark as paid.\n6. Type marked as paid and send it.\n7. Select \"marked\" on the message sent in Step 6 > right click on the message > Copy to clipboard.\n8. Paste the copied text in the composer.\n→ \"marked\" is pasted in the composer.\n9. Select \"marked\" on the paid system message in Step 5 > right click on the message > Copy to clipboard.\n10. Paste the copied text in the composer.\n\n## Expected Result:\n\"marked\" will be pasted in the composer.\n\n## Actual Result:\nThe entire system message \"marked as paid\" is pasted in the composer, which is different from the behavior when text is selected individually in the sent message in Step 8.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2de04722-7502-4ea5-8700-b99446745100\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Mita Rachim\n> Bug ID: 7201125","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/95463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/95463/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":