","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug Report\n\n**Description:**\nWhen the create modal is open on the Spend tab and the user navigates back using the browser's back button, the UI becomes unclickable/unresponsive.\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n1. Go to Home\n2. Navigate to the Spend tab and tap **Create**\n3. Press the browser back button\n\n## Expected Result\nThe UI should remain fully interactive after navigating back.\n\n## Actual Result\nThe UI is unclickable/unresponsive after navigating back.\n\n## Additional Context\nOriginally reported via Applause bug report.\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067657900895851207\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022067657900895851207</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2067657900895851207</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-18</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93955/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93955/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdguardTeam/AdguardFilters/issues/234652","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdguardTeam/AdguardFilters","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdguardTeam/AdguardFilters/issues/234652/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdguardTeam/AdguardFilters/issues/234652/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AdguardTeam/AdguardFilters/issues/2