igin – Badware risks<br><br>**Language-specific:**<br>AdGuard Russian filter\nTracking protection: | **General**:<br>Block trackers, <br>Strip URLs from tracking parameters, <br>Hide your search queries, <br>Send Do-Not-Track header<br><br>**Miscellaneous**:<br>Remove X-Client-Data header from HTTP requests\nDNS filtering: | server: `https://dns.google/dns-query`, `https://dns.cloudflare.com/dns-query`, `https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query`, `https://1.1.1.1/dns-query`, `https://1.0.0.1/dns-query`, `tls://1.1.1.1`, `tls://1.0.0.1`, `tls://8.8.8.8`, `tls://8.8.4.4`\nBrowsing Security: | enabled\nBrowsing Security statistics: | disabled\nUserscripts: | `https://userscripts.adtidy.org/release/adguard-extra/1.0/adguard-extra.meta.js`\nUserstyles: | disabled\n\n\n\n### Issue configuration\n[Import](https://reports.adguard.com/settings/import.html?product_type=and&amp;product_version=4.12.3&amp;system_version=Android+16&amp;browser=yandex&amp;filters=3.1.2.208.18.118.21.255.256.11.20.19.257.17&amp;dns.servers=https%3A%2F%2Fdns.google%2Fdns-query%2Chttps%3A%2F%2Fdns.cloudflare.com%2Fdns-query%2Chttps%3A%2F%2Fcloudflare-dns.com%2Fdns-query%2Chttps%3A%2F%2F1.1.1.1%2Fdns-query%2Chttps%3A%2F%2F1.0.0.1%2Fdns-query%2Ctls%3A%2F%2F1.1.1.1%2Ctls%3A%2F%2F1.0.0.1%2Ctls%3A%2F%2F8.8.8.8%2Ctls%3A%2F%2F8.8.4.4&amp;userscripts=https%253A%252F%252Fuserscripts.adtidy.org%252Frelease%252Fadguard-extra%252F1.0%252Fadguard-extra.meta.js&amp;android.mode=VPN&amp;android.system_root=true&amp;dns.filters_enabled=false&amp;dns.enabled=true&amp;https.filtering=true&amp;browsing_security.enabled=true&amp;browsing_security.statistics_enabled=false&amp;stealth.enabled=true&amp;stealth.webrtc=false&amp;stealth.push=false&amp;stealth.location=false&amp;stealth.strip_url=true&amp;stealth.hide_search_queries=true&amp;stealth.DNT=true&amp;stealth.referrer=&amp;stealth.x_client=true&amp;stealth.dpi=false&amp;stealth.third_party_cookies=180&amp;stealth.first_party_cookies=4320&amp;stealth.disable_third_part