.com/users/rojiphil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rojiphil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rojiphil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rojiphil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rojiphil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rojiphil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding and email contributors@expensify.com to request to join our Slack channel!\n___\n\n**Version Number:** 9.3.25-0\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** No\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/79766\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** jsodjsodnjoisjdosij@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Pull Request QA execution\n**Device used:** Mac 26.2 / Chrome\n**App Component:** Money Requests\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Go to staging.new.expensify.com\n2. Create an expense in self DM.\n3. Create an expense in workspace chat.\n4. Go to Reports > Expenses.\n5. Open the workspace expense.\n6. Click More > Merge.\n7. Select self DM expense > Continue.\n8. Select second option in each section > Next > Merge expenses.\n→ Transaction thread opens.\n\n9. Create an expense in self DM.\n10. Create an expense in workspace chat.\n11. Go to Reports > Expenses.\n12. Select workspace expense via checkbox.\n13. Click dropdown button > Merge.\n14. Select self DM expense > Continue.\n15. Select second option in each section > Next > Merge expenses.\n\n## Expected Result:\nTransaction thread will open after merging expenses via bulk option (similar to Step 8).\n\n## Actual Result:\nSelf DM opens after merging expenses via bulk option.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aef54d64-c740-4fa5-9d8c-7dbacf9d3857\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @rojiphil</details>\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022026066651163126006</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2026066651163126006</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-02-23</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/83257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/83257/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/73656","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/73656/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/73656/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/73656/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/73656","id":3562244469,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7UU4l1","number":73656,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-06-30] [Due for pa