os_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorretheboy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorretheboy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lorretheboy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":76,"created_at":"2025-10-28T15:54:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:36:58Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"tgolen","id":1228807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjg4MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1228807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen","html_url":"https://github.com/tgolen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/73647","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This is part of deprecating Onyx.connect. [Parent Issue](https://github.com/Expensify/Expensify/issues/522215)\n\n## Details\n- **Module**: [src/libs/actions/Report.ts](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/main/src/libs/actions/Report.ts)\n- **Onyx Key**: `ONYXKEYS.PERSONAL_DETAILS_LIST`\n- **Reference**: `Line 351: ONYXKEYS.PERSONAL_DETAILS_LIST`\n\nBe sure to refactor methods using test driven development:\n1. Create a unit test for methods before refactoring\n2. Refactor the methods\n3. Ensure the unit test still runs after refactoring\n4. Reinforce the unit testing with a functional test and a QA test\n5. Once you are done, decrease the number of allowable ESLint warnings [here](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/e7b5ac9401e2ae9b5c2c70ec513e8de6f5279d7d/package.json#L48) to equal the number of `Onyx.connect` references remaining in the code\n\n\n\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @parasharrajat</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/73656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/73656/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmyznikov/PyEnv-WoA-State/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmyznikov/PyEnv-WoA-State","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmyznikov/PyEnv-WoA-State/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmyznikov/PyEnv-WoA-State/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/khmyznikov/PyEnv-WoA-State/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/khmyznikov/PyEnv-WoA-State/issues/1","id":3076742726,"node_id":"I_kwDOOtP8Ps63Y15G","number":1,"title":"[Tracker] WoA🐍Libs🦾","user":{"login":"khmyznikov","id":6115884,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTU4ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6115884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov","html_url":"https://github.com/khmyznikov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"khmyznikov","id":6115884,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTU4ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6115884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov","html_url":"https://github.com/khmyznikov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":63,"created_at":"2025-05-20T11:51:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T03:36:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"khmyznikov","id":6115884,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTU4ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6115884?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov","html_url":"https://github.com/khmyznikov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/khmyznikov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":34,"completed":18,"percent_completed":52},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## **WoA🐍Libs**🦾\n\n## Willing to participate, but don't have the hardware? Reach the [Arm Developer Lab](https://arm-university.github.io/Arm-Developer-Labs/2025/11/03/Python-Porting-Challenge.html)!\n\n### Python libs missing natively on Windows Arm64\n\nThese lists are designed to prioritize libraries that need to be fixed for Python development natively on WoA.\nBased on [this](https://tonybaloney.github.io/windows-arm64-wheels/) public list of **top 1000** python packages by downloads. *Orange* 11% packages were investigated by automatic tests.\n\nAs of **Jun 6,** 2026, these lists are only the **5%** [of top **1000**](https://tonybaloney.github.io/windows-arm64-wheels/), the rest **95%** already have native wheels or don't need them.\n\n⬛ - No Win binaries / other hard block\n❌ - No win_arm64 binaries/wheels available on PyPi\n⁉️ - No response from maintainers\n🟡 - Contribution was accepted, waiting for PyPi release\n✅ - Globally available via PyPi\n\n### Contribution instructions\n\nIf you are already working on some of these libraries or just starting, here's how you can help others track your progress:\n\n1. Request access to this repo in the comments.\n2. Create a sub-issue with package name.\n3. Copy all information from table and and sync any additional.\n4. Work and share your progress in the issue. The issue can be closed only after the wheel lands on PyPi.\n\n### Libraries what not easy to build locally\n\nRequired noticable effort to build locally and contribute back to the community. <br>Some of the packages are blocked by others, making their build complexity unclear.\n\n| Done | Tool | Issue | PR | Depend | Notes | Assigned | ETA/Wheel |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ❌ | **[pyarrow](https://github.com/apache/arrow)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/apache/arrow/issues/45082) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/apache/arrow/pull/48539) | - | QC: PR work is in progress | #25  | - |\n| ❌ | **deltalake** | - | - | pyarrow | Coupled with pyarrow | - | - |\n| ❌ | **[jaxlib](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/28709) | - | SciPy | Google's library | - | - |\n| ⬛ | **[grpcio](https://pypi.org/project/grpcio/)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/issues/39362) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/grpc/grpc/pull/39624) | - | RP rejected. Infra blocked. | #6 | [🔗temp](https://github.com/khmyznikov/PyEnv-WoA-State/releases?q=grpc&expanded=true) |\n| ❌ | **grpcio-tools** | - | - | grpcio | Coupled with grpcio | - | - |\n| ❌ | **[ray](https://github.com/ray-project/ray)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/ray-project/ray/issues/52966) | - | - | QC: Lack of grpcio holds this enablement, in discussion with maintainers | - | - |\n| 🟡 | **[numba](https://github.com/numba/numba)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/numba/numba/issues/10066) | - | llvmlite, conda | Waiting for release| #37 | - |\n| 🟡 | **[llvmlite](https://github.com/numba/llvmlite)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/numba/llvmlite/issues/1170#issuecomment-2859935787) | [Related PR](https://github.com/numba/llvmlite/pull/1426) | - | Waiting for release | #24  | - |\n| ❌ | **[shap](https://github.com/shap/shap)** | - | - | numba | QC: Waiting for numba enablement | #38  | - |\n| ❌ | **librosa** | - | - | Numba | Coupled with Numba | - | - |\n| ❌ | **[triton-windows](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-windows)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-windows/issues/25) | - | - | Support only x86 and Nvidia GPU, QC started investigation | #40 | - |\n| ⁉️ | **[confluent-kafka](https://github.com/confluentinc/confluent-kafka-python)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/confluentinc/confluent-kafka-python/issues/1981) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/confluentinc/confluent-kafka-python/pull/2190) | - | QC: no response from maintainers | #42 | - |\n| ❌ | **[opencv-python](https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python/issues/1092) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/opencv/opencv-python/pull/1143) | - | - |  #36  | - |\n| ❌ | **[onnxruntime](https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/issues/19161) | - | - | Alternative package is [onnxruntime-qnn](https://pypi.org/project/onnxruntime-qnn) There's confusion between the packages | - | - |\n| ❌ | **[apache-beam](https://github.com/apache/beam)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/apache/beam/issues/34916) | - | grpcio | QC: started investigation | #39 | - |\n| ⁉️ | **sglang** | - | [🔗PR](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/pull/19706) | torch, torchvision, torchaudio, PyArrow, grpcio | linux only, a lot of unresolved deps | - | - |\n| ❌ | **[psycopg-binary](https://github.com/psycopg/psycopg)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/psycopg/psycopg/issues/1087) | - | - | Blocked by [libpq](https://commitfest.postgresql.org/patch/3561/), [discussion](https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/flat/CAFPTBD-74%2BAEuN9n7caJ0YUnW5A0r-KBX8rYoEJWqFPgLKpzdg%40mail.gmail.com) | - | - |\n| ⁉️ | **[pymupdf](https://github.com/pymupdf/PyMuPDF)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/pymupdf/PyMuPDF/issues/4498) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/mupdf/pull/83) | - | QC: no response from maintainers | - | - |\n| ❌ | **pymssql** | - | - | - | mssql don't support win-arm | - | - |\n| ❌ | **oracledb** | - | - | cryptography | Oracle DB don't support win-arm64. Coupled with cryptography | - | - |\n| ❌ | **petf** | - | - | - | - | - | - |\n| ⬛ | **tree-sitter-languages** | - | - | - | Not maintained, arm64 successor is [tree-sitter-language-pack](https://pypi.org/project/tree-sitter-language-pack/#files) | - | - |\n| ❌ | **cuda-bindings** | - | - | - | - | - | - |\n| ❌ | **temporalio** | - | - | - | - | - | - |\n| ❌ | **[tensorflow-io-gcs-filesystem](https://github.com/tensorflow/io)** | - | - | - | Google's library | - | - |\n| ❌ | **[tensorflow](https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/issues/84102) | - | - | Google's library | - | - |\n| ❌ | **tensorflow-text** | - | - | - | Google's library | - | - |\n| 🟡 | **bitsandbytes** | - | [🔗PR](https://github.com/bitsandbytes-foundation/bitsandbytes/pull/1959) | - | - | - | - |\n| 🟡 | **[cryptography](https://github.com/pyca/cryptography)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/pyca/cryptography/issues/11199) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/pyca/cryptography/pull/14346) | - | Support dropped due [GH image issues](https://github.com/actions/runner-images/issues/14058) | - | [🔗pypi](https://pypi.org/project/cryptography/#files) |\n| 🟡 | **[snowflake-connector-python](https://github.com/snowflakedb/snowflake-connector-python)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/snowflakedb/snowflake-connector-python/issues/2314) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/snowflakedb/snowflake-connector-python/pull/2478) | cryptography | [Testing is required to accept](https://github.com/snowflakedb/snowflake-connector-python/issues/2314#issuecomment-3388920383) | #27  |  No ETA |\n| 🟡 | **[shapely](https://github.com/shapely/shapely)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/shapely/shapely/issues/2296) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/shapely/shapely/pull/2307) | - | - | #13  | [~Q2 26](https://github.com/shapely/shapely/issues/2413) |\n| 🟡 | **[h5py](https://github.com/h5py/h5py)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/h5py/h5py/issues/2578) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/h5py/h5py/pull/2653) | - | [Support disabled due CI failure](https://github.com/h5py/h5py/issues/2816) | #29  | [🔗pypi](https://pypi.org/project/h5py/#files) |\n| 🟡 | **torchvision** | - | - | PR merged | [Nightly wheels available](https://download.pytorch.org/whl/nightly/torchvision/) | - | - |\n| 🟡 | **statsmodels**| [🔗Issue](https://github.com/statsmodels/statsmodels/issues/9629) |- | [NumPy issues holds the enablement](https://github.com/numpy/numpy/issues/29442) | - | - |\n| 🟡 | **[blis](https://github.com/explosion/cython-blis)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/explosion/cython-blis/issues/120) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/explosion/cython-blis/pull/123) | - | Release waits for [free-threading](https://py-free-threading.github.io/tracking/) | #19  | Q1 2026 |\n| 🟡 | **[pynacl](https://github.com/pyca/pynacl)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/pyca/pynacl/issues/775) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/pyca/pynacl/pull/864) | - | Support dropped due [GH image issues](https://github.com/pyca/pynacl/pull/944) | - | [🔗pypi](https://pypi.org/project/PyNaCl/1.6.0/#files) |\n| ✅ | **[thinc](https://github.com/explosion/thinc)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/explosion/thinc/issues/955) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/explosion/thinc/pull/957) | - | [Only 8.x available](https://github.com/explosion/cython-blis/issues/120#issuecomment-3625900820) on pypi | #28  | [🔗pypi](https://pypi.org/project/thinc/8.3.10/#files) |\n| ✅ | **[scipy](https://github.com/scipy/scipy)** | [🔗Issue](https://github.com/scipy/scipy/issues/21562) | [🔗PR](https://github.com/scipy/scipy/pull/23122) | numpy | PR merged | #8  | [🔗pypi](https://pypi.org/project/scipy/) |\n| ✅ | **[lxml](https://github.com/lxml/lxml)** | - | [🔗PR](https://github.com/lxml/lxml/pull/465) | - | - | - | [🔗pypi](https://pypi.org/project/lxml/#files) |\n| ✅ | *