":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-07-07T02:17:48Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:18:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Introduction to CodeQL\n\n<img alt=\"original github octocat\" src=\"https://octodex.github.com/images/original.png\" align=\"left\" height=\"80px\" />\n\n👋 Hey there @jeanpmodev! Welcome to your Skills exercise!\n\nLearn to use CodeQL to find security vulnerabilities in your code.\n\n---\n\n✨ **This is an interactive, hands-on GitHub Skills exercise!**\n\nAs you complete each step, I’ll leave updates in the comments:\n\n- ✅ Check your work and guide you forward\n- 💡 Share helpful tips and resources\n- 🚀 Celebrate your progress and completion\n\nLet’s get started - good luck and have fun!\n\n<sub>— Mona</sub>\n> <sub> If you encounter any issues along the way please report them [here](https://github.com/skills/introduction-to-codeql/issues).</sub>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeanpmodev/skills-introduction-to-codeql/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jeanpmodev/skills-introduction-to-codeql/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/issues/144","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/issues/144/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/issues/144/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/issues/144/events","html_url":"https://github.com/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/issues/144","id":4819841079,"node_id":"I_kwDOJmA8y88AAAABH0jwNw","number":144,"title":"Instagram posts scraper broken by latest insta update","user":{"login":"alukan","id":64636633,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NjM2NjMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64636633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan","html_url":"https://github.com/alukan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alukan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5530904028,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJmA8y88AAAABSarl3A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-06T13:58:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T02:17:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Scraper**\nInstagram posts scraper\n\nDescribe the bug         \n  scrape_post returns null data when querying https://www.instagram.com/graphql/query with doc_id=8845758582119845. The response body is {\"errors\":[{\"message\":\"execution \n  error\",\"severity\":\"CRITICAL\"}],\"data\":null,\"status\":\"ok\"}.                                                                                                                             \n   \n  Received Output                                                                                                                                                                        \n  {                                                                                                                                                                                    \n    \"errors\": [                                                                                                                                                                          \n      {        \n        \"message\": \"execution error\",                                                                                                                                                    \n        \"severity\": \"CRITICAL\"                                                                                                                                                         \n      }                       \n    ], \n    \"data\": null,\n    \"status\": \"ok\"\n  }               \n   \n  Expected Output\n  {                                                                                                                                                                                      \n    \"data\": {\n      \"xdt_shortcode_media\": {                                                                                                                                                           \n        \"shortcode\": \"DAE-iFct739\",                                                                                                                                                    \n        \"edge_media_preview_like\": { \"count\": ... },                                                                                                                                     \n        \"edge_media_to_parent_comment\": { \"count\": ... },                                                                                                                                \n        \"video_view_count\": ...                                                                                                                                                          \n      }                                                                                                                                                                                  \n    }                                                                                                                                                                                  \n  }                                                                                                                                                                                      \n                                                                                                                                                                                       \n  Additional context\n  - Script: scrapfly-insta.py from scrapfly.io/blog/how-to-scrape-instagram                                                                                                              \n  - Config: asp=True, country=\"CA\"                                                                                                                                                       \n  - Endpoint: POST https://www.instagram.com/graphql/query                                                                                                                               \n  - doc_id: 8845758582119845 (taken directly from the blog article)                                                                                                                      \n  - Test shortcode: DAE-iFct739                                                                                                                                                        \n  - The same doc_id also fails when tested directly via Node.js with a residential proxy, suggesting the doc_id itself may be stale/rotated by Instagram                                 \n                                                                         ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/issues/144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scrapfly/scrapfly-scrapers/issues/144/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90362","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90362/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90362/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90362/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/90362","id":4431197817,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABCB62eQ","number":90362,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-01] [$250] Inline Hyperlinks in Chat Messages Break Onto Separate Line Instead of Wrapping Naturally","user":{"login":"m-natarajan","id":38435837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4NDM1ODM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38435837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan","html_url":"https://github.com/m-natarajan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m-natarajan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api