/api.github.com/users/annaweber830/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annaweber830/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annaweber830/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/annaweber830/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":38,"created_at":"2026-05-22T16:11:46Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T01:50:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"stitesExpensify","id":42391420,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzkxNDIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42391420?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify","html_url":"https://github.com/stitesExpensify","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stitesExpensify/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem\n\nSelf-authored posts/actions in chat threads are being marked as unread, causing threads to appear bold in the LHN when they shouldn't be. A user's own messages should never trigger unread indicators for that same user.\n\nThis was surfaced during investigation of https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/76677, where the IOU thread appears bold in the LHN for the message sender after they send a message in the thread. The specific issue there is scoped to IOU threads, but the underlying problem is broader: **any self-authored post should never be marked as unread for the author.**\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\n- When a user sends a message or performs an action (e.g., editing an expense), that action should not be marked as unread for the author\n- The LHN should not show the thread as bold for the user who authored the most recent action\n- The \"New message\" marker should not appear above the user's own messages\n\n## Investigation Areas\n\n- How `lastReadTime` / unread state is updated when a user sends a message vs. receives one\n- Whether system-generated messages (e.g., expense edit notifications) correctly attribute authorship for unread calculations\n- Whether there are race conditions between optimistic message creation and unread state updates\n- Whether the unread logic correctly distinguishes between \"messages I authored\" and \"messages others authored\" across all message types\n\n## Related\n\n- https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/76677 — specific instance involving IOU thread unread state after sending a message\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022057859236215654318\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022057859236215654318</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2057859236215654318</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-05-22</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91443/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91443/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/80943","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/80943/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/80943/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/80943/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/80943","id":3872382471,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7mz94H","number":80943,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-03] Video - Video is not playing in full screen, no controls, app is unresponsive","user":{"login":"vincdargento","id":35436778,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NDM2Nzc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35436778?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento","html_url":"https://github.com/vincdargento","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vincdargento/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2873246102,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODczMjQ2MTAy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/External","name":"External","color":"a7b8ef","default":false,"description":"Added to denote the issue can be worked on by a contributor"},{"id":2893455829,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZW