rganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cretadn22/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cretadn22/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cretadn22/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cretadn22/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":115,"created_at":"2025-07-16T20:50:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T22:38:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"tgolen","id":1228807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjg4MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1228807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen","html_url":"https://github.com/tgolen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgolen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66410","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This is part of deprecating Onyx.connect. [Parent Issue](https://github.com/Expensify/Expensify/issues/522215)\n\n## Details\n- **Module**: [src/libs/ReportUtils.ts](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/main/src/libs/ReportUtils.ts)\n- **Onyx Key**: `ONYXKEYS.CONCIERGE_REPORT_ID`\n- **Reference**: `Line 893: ONYXKEYS.CONCIERGE_REPORT_ID`\n\nBe sure to refactor methods using test driven development:\n1. Create a unit test for methods before refactoring\n2. Refactor the methods\n3. Ensure the unit test still runs after refactoring\n4. Reinforce the unit testing with a functional test and a QA test\n5. Once you are done, decrease the number of allowable ESLint warnings [here](https://github.com/Expensify/App/blob/e7b5ac9401e2ae9b5c2c70ec513e8de6f5279d7d/package.json#L48) to equal the number of `Onyx.connect` references remaining in the code\n\n\n\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @DylanDylann</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66411/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"reopened","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/issues/2822","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/issues/2822/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/issues/2822/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/issues/2822/events","html_url":"https://github.com/viamin/paid/issues/2822","id":4820496055,"node_id":"I_kwDOQ_VJgM8AAAABH1Lutw","number":2822,"title":"Profile chat tools + batched plan-then-apply UX (RDR-044 Phase 2)","user":{"login":"viamin","id":260794,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDc5NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260794?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin","html_url":"https://github.com/viamin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/viamin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10046397520,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQ_VJgM8AAAACVs_cUA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"a2eeef","default":true,"description":"New feature or request"},{"id":10073159627,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQ_VJgM8AAAACWGg3yw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/labels/ui","name":"ui","color":"C2E0C6","default":false,"description":"Web UI, Hotwire, views"},{"id":10329814744,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQ_VJgM8AAAACZ7R22A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/labels/agents","name":"agents","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"description":"Agent workflow integration"},{"id":10633601441,"node_id":"LA_kwDOQ_VJgM8AAAACec_hoQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/labels/P1","name":"P1","color":"931406","default":false,"description":"High priority"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-06T15:15:12Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T22:38:07Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Part of #2820. Implements **Phase 2** of [RDR-044](docs/rdrs/RDR-044-configuration-profiles-chat.md).\n\nDepends on #2821.\n\n## Goal\n\nExpose Phase 1's profile core to the interactive chat so a user can say \"set up Paid for a solo fully-automated workflow\" and get: recommend → clarify → plan → confirm → apply, with **one** confirmation for the whole posture.\n\n## Scope\n\n1. **`list_configuration_profiles`** (read tool) — returns `Registry.summaries` plus which levels each profile touches.\n2. **`plan_configuration_profile`** (read tool) — `{ profile_id:, project_id:, overrides: }` → serialized `Plan` (changes with before/after, prerequisites, clarifying questions). Executes no writes; the LLM never authors the diff.\n3. **`apply_configuration_profile`** (write tool, `:pre_dispatch`) — `{ profile_id:, project_id:, overrides:, confirmed: }`. On `confirmed`: builds plan, checks **per-level** authorization (skip un-permitted levels with a reported reason), enforces prerequisites, runs `Applier.apply` in a transaction, returns per-change results. One human confirmation applies the whole bundle.\n4. **System-prompt guidance** — extend `ChatSessions::BuildSystemPrompt#base_identity` so the chat reaches for profiles instead of inventing settings.\n5. **UI** — render a grouped before/after diff in the tool-call confirmation card (`app/views/chat_messages/_tool_call.html.erb`) driven by the serialized `Plan`; add rendering helpers.\n\n## Files\n\n- Create: `app/mcp/tools/{list_configuration_profiles,plan_configuration_profile,apply_configuration_profile}.rb`\n- Modify: `app/mcp/tools/registry.rb` (register tools)\n- Modify: `app/services/chat_sessions/build_system_prompt.rb`\n- Modify: `app/views/chat_messages/_tool_call.html.erb`, `app/helpers/chat_sessions_helper.rb`\n\n## Validation\n\n- Tool specs mirroring existing settings-tool specs for all three tools: authorization (per-level), `confirmed` enforcement, skip-on-deny, prerequisite blocking, structured result shape.\n- Request-level chat spec for the recommend → plan → apply round trip.\n\n## Design constraints (RDR-044)\n\n- Tools run under `TenantContext.with(account)`; RLS enforces tenant isolation.\n- `confirmed` is stripped from advertised schemas and injected only by the human approver (existing mechanic, RDR-028).\n- Tenant-level changes require admin/owner (`AccountPolicy#update?`), matching `update_tenant_settings`; skip-with-reason for non-admin callers.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/issues/2822/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/viamin/paid/issues/2822/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/92416","id":4574195770,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABEKSwOg","number":92416,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-06] [$250] [Sentry: APP-4FK] HybridApp Android NullPointerException in expo TaskService.executeTask","user":{"login":"mountiny","id":36083550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDgzNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36083550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny","html_url":"https://github.com/mountiny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/events{/privacy}","received_events_u