TRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/91302","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Sentry\nhttps://expensify.sentry.io/issues/APP-4FK\n\n## Impact (snapshot at filing)\n- Users (total since first seen): **154**\n- Events: 5,369\n- Users (last 14d): ongoing on 9.3.89–9.3.91\n- First seen: 2026-01-22\n- Last seen: now (ongoing)\n- Platform: Android, hybrid_app\n- App version(s): seen through 9.3.91\n- Mechanism: `chained`, fatal\n\n## Stack trace (top frames, first-party only)\n```\nexpo.modules.taskManager.TaskService in executeTask\n  -> java.lang.NullPointerException\n```\n\n## Suspected cause\nExpo background `TaskService` receives a null context or task payload on Android HybridApp when executing a registered background task.\n\n## Reproduction\nUnknown deterministically — see linked Sentry events for Android HybridApp sessions.\n\n## Related\n- Sibling Sentry IDs (if any): none identified\n- Prior GH issues: none\n- Production scan: releases 9.3.89, 9.3.90, 9.3.91 (2026-06-02)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885299179690169\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022061885299179690169</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2061885299179690169</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-16</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92416/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"