Phone 15 iOS 26.5\n**App Component:** Search\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Sign in to ND\n2. Create a workspace\n3. Go to Spend tab/ Expenses\n4. Type \"type:chat category:abcd\" in the search field, apply the search\n\n## Expected Result:\n\"Something went wrong\" page appears and does not flash\n\n## Actual Result:\n\"Something went wrong\" page flashes\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b7c1610-c570-4da9-a618-b7901b7ec7c8\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Mita Rachim\n> Bug ID: 7170088\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022062004611029237958\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022062004611029237958</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2062004611029237958</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-10</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92462/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93788","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93788/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93788/comments","events_url":"https://api.github