forms where the issue was reproduced:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [x] MacOS: Chrome / Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff09f8a3-f134-4271-ae1f-9acae5352a33\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060375735002661347\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022060375735002661347</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2060375735002661347</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-06-05</li>\n<li>Automatic offers: </li>\n<ul>\n<li>apeyada | Contributor | 111712171</li>\n</ul></li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/92089/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90646","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90646/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90646/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90646/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/90646","id":4445595745,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABCPpoYQ","number":90646,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-06] Improve line chart styling with marker borders, gradient fill, and brand green color","user":{"login":"MelvinBot","id":12432488,"node_id":"MDQ6V