com/users/puneetlath/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\n\nThe line charts (particularly **Spend over time**) feel unpolished. This issue tracks the following visual improvements:\n\n1. **Marker borders** — Add borders/strokes to the data point markers on the line chart\n2. **Linear gradient fill** — Add a linear gradient to the area/spread beneath the line\n3. **Brand green color** — Switch the chart color from blue to Expensify's primary brand green to reinforce brand identity and feel more polished\n\nThese changes have been confirmed as feasible using the combination of `victory-native` and `skia`.\n\n**Slack thread:** https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C07HPDRELLD/p1778752346310759\n\n<img width=\"2800\" height=\"1744\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f90e8869-f5ff-43cc-937a-4a9557eb390f\" />\n\n<img width=\"1494\" height=\"1154\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c71692fc-5bbd-443d-955c-a4043689525e\" />\n\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @puneetlath</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90646/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/90646/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"