vents","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"dubielzyk-expensify","id":145416827,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKriew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145416827?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify","html_url":"https://github.com/dubielzyk-expensify","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"thelullabyy","id":182625428,"node_id":"U_kgDOCuKklA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182625428?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy","html_url":"https://github.com/thelullabyy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thelullabyy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":25,"created_at":"2026-05-02T21:47:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:54:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"yuwenmemon","id":4741899,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NDE4OTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4741899?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon","html_url":"https://github.com/yuwenmemon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuwenmemon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent: Expensify/Expensify#589894\nDesign doc: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qQXU4EIij-OyCpk6z8idi0ch0rP4XtIQ0770STZeF5E/edit\n\n## Scope\n\nPSA scaffolding — adds the constants, screen names, routes, navigator registrations, write commands, action functions, and the beta-flag removal needed for the PSA-specific pages built in subsequent Release 2 issues. Nothing user-visible lands in this issue on its own.\n\n## Implementation notes (from design doc)\n\n### 1. `src/CONST/index.ts` — Add PSA config keys\n\nExtend `CERTINIA_CONFIG`:\n\n```ts\nPARENT_TAG_MAPPING:      'parentTagMapping',\nSYNC_MILESTONES:         'syncMilestones',\nREPORT_EXPORT_STATUS:    'reportExportStatus',\nTAX_NON_BILLABLE:        'taxNonBillable',\nEXPORT_FOREIGN_CURRENCY: 'exportForeignCurrency',\n```\n\n### 2. `src/SCREENS.ts` — Add PSA screen names\n\n```ts\nCERTINIA_TAGS_MAPPING:         'Policy_Accounting_Certinia_Tags_Mapping',\nCERTINIA_REPORT_EXPORT_STATUS: 'Policy_Accounting_Certinia_Report_Export_Status',\nCERTINIA_COMPANY_SELECTOR:     'Policy_Accounting_Certinia_Company_Selector',\n```\n\n### 3. `src/ROUTES.ts` — Add PSA routes\n\n```ts\nPOLICY_ACCOUNTING_CERTINIA_TAGS_MAPPING:\n    route: 'workspaces/:policyID/accounting/certinia/import/tags-mapping'\n\nPOLICY_ACCOUNTING_CERTINIA_REPORT_EXPORT_STATUS:\n    route: 'workspaces/:policyID/accounting/certinia/export/report-status'\n\nPOLICY_ACCOUNTING_CERTINIA_COMPANY_SELECTOR:\n    route: 'workspaces/:policyID/accounting/certinia/company'\n```\n\n### 4. `src/libs/Navigation/AppNavigator/ModalStackNavigators/index.tsx` — Register PSA screens\n\n```tsx\n[SCREENS.WORKSPACE.ACCOUNTING.CERTINIA_TAGS_MAPPING]: () =>\n    require('...certinia/import/CertiniaTagsMappingPage').default,\n[SCREENS.WORKSPACE.ACCOUNTING.CERTINIA_REPORT_EXPORT_STATUS]: () =>\n    require('...certinia/export/CertiniaReportExportStatusPage').default,\n[SCREENS.WORKSPACE.ACCOUNTING.CERTINIA_COMPANY_SELECTOR]: () =>\n    require('...certinia/CertiniaCompanySelectorPage').default,\n```\n\n### 5. `src/libs/API/types.ts` — Add PSA `WriteCommands`\n\n```ts\nUPDATE_FINANCIAL_FORCE_PARENT_TAG_MAPPING:      'UpdateFinancialForceParentTagMapping',\nUPDATE_FINANCIAL_FORCE_SYNC_MILESTONES:         'UpdateFinancialForceSyncMilestones',\nUPDATE_FINANCIAL_FORCE_REPORT_EXPORT_STATUS:    'UpdateFinancialForceReportExportStatus',\nUPDATE_FINANCIAL_FORCE_TAX_NON_BILLABLE:        'UpdateFinancialForceTaxNonBillable',\nUPDATE_FINANCIAL_FORCE_EXPORT_FOREIGN_CURRENCY: 'UpdateFinancialForceExportForeignCurrency',\nUPDATE_FINANCIAL_FORCE_COMPANY:                 'UpdateFinancialForceCompany',\n```\n\nAdd matching parameter types under `src/libs/API/parameters/`.\n\n### 6. `src/libs/actions/connections/FinancialForce.ts` — Add PSA action functions\n\nUsing the same `prepareOnyxDataForFinancialForceUpdate` helper from Release 1:\n\n- `updateFinancialForceParentTagMapping(policyID, value)` → `connections.financialForce.config.coding.parentTagMapping`\n- `updateFinancialForceSyncMilestones(policyID, enabled)` → `connections.financialForce.config.coding.syncMilestones`\n- `updateFinancialForceReportExportStatus(policyID, status)` → `connections.financialForce.config.export.exportStatus`\n- `updateFinancialForceTaxNonBillable(policyID, enabled)` → `connections.financialForce.config.advanced.taxNonBillable`\n- `updateFinancialForceExportForeignCurrency(policyID, enabled)` → `connections.financialForce.config.advanced.exportForeignCurrency`\n- `updateFinancialForceCompany(policyID, companyID)` → `connections.financialForce.config.credentials.companyID`\n\n## Tests\n\n- Type-check: `npx tsc --noEmit` clean.\n- Beta flag absent — Certinia card is visible to all users (verify on staging once this lands, since user-visible toggling).\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @mallenexpensify</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89438/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/89438/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/86064","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/86064/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/86064/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/86064/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/86064","id":4117407507,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc71aqcT","number":86064,"title":"[$250] Action Badge: Show GBR/RBR action pill at top of chat when action badge is above scroll window","user":{"login":"quinthar","id":575186,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NTE4Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/575186?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar","html_url":"https://github.com/quinthar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quinthar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2893455829,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODkzNDU1ODI5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Daily","name":"Daily","color":"eb6420","default":false,"description":"KSv2"},{"id":2893524800,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODkzNTI0ODAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Improvement","name":"Improvement","color":"604c8d","default":false,"description":"Item broken or needs improvement."},{"id":3184150925,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMTg0MTUwOTI1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/labels/Overdue","name":"Overdue","color":"D93F0B","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"mallenexpensify","id":22508304,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNTA4MzA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22508304?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify","html_url":"https://github.com/mallenexpensify","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mallenexpensify/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"aimane-chnaif","id":96077027,"node_id":"U_kgDOBboE4w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96077027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif","html_url":"https://github.com/aimane-chnaif","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aimane-chnaif/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":32,"created_at":"2026-03-22T23:47:05Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:53:48Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"carlosmiceli","id":1166066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjYwNjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli","html_url":"https://github.com/carlosmiceli","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carlosmiceli/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Description\n\nWhen you are in a chat that has an outstanding GBR/RBR (action badge), and the report action causing that badge is **above** the current scroll window, we should show a colored \"pill\" indicator at the top of the chat that scrolls the user directly to the relevant report action.\n\n## Current Behavior\n\nCurrently when you scroll backwards in a chat, we show a \"pill\" at the top indicating:\n- If you have unread messages \"beneath\" you, it links straight to the oldest unread message\n- If you are scrolled \"too far\" back, it shows a pill that links you to the bottom of the chat\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3962c6cc-3d88-420a-99c1-5174c6724697\n\n<img width=\"2168\" height=\"412\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e645b91f-30f4-4803-8a45-34bea4e99292\" />\n\n<img width=\"2164\" height=\"324\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7cf16dcc-7dd4-4cdc-b4e5-85702d44ac9d\" />\n\n## Expected Behavior\n\nAdd a new pill behavior:\n- If there is an action badge **above** the current scroll window, show a green/red \"Approve/Pay/Fix/etc\" pill at the top of the screen with a \"^\" arrow\n- When clicked, it takes you straight to the row that is causing the LHN to have the \"action badge\"\n- The pill color should match the badge type (green for GBR, red for RBR)\n- The pill text should reflect the required action (e.g., \"Approve\", \"Pay\", \"Fix\", etc.)\n- The pill should take precedence over any other pill, so the order of priority is:\n  - Action badge, if any.\n  - If not, the unread badge, if there are unread message.\n  - If not, the new message badge.\n\n## Context\n\nThis is the final piece of the GBR/RBR system — previously referred to as \"Release 3: Show a GBR/RBR pill on the chat.\"\n\ncc `quinthar`\n\n\n\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022056770121219412994</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2056770121219412994</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-05-19</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @aimane-chnaif</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/86064/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/86064/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/85560","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/85560/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/85560/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/85560/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/85560","id":4089478582,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7zwH22","number":85560,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-13] [$250] Audit Reports navigation and prioritize navigating to report routes","user":{"login":"luacmartins","id":22219519,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjE5NTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22219519?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/luacmartins","html_url":"https://github.com/luacmartins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luacmartins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luacmartins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luacmartins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/luacmartins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co