"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"For our desktop tables we want to edit inline editing to allow users to quickly edit certain fields. Here's a rough demo followed by more detailed specs underneath:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ece98b01-8eeb-4b06-bd4c-584cc3e607d8\n\n\n\nHere are some interaction specs:\n\n<img width=\"2456\" height=\"938\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3e7e0db1-207c-4130-b40c-c82c9801eeb2\" />\n\nThe cells are:\n- 32px tall\n- 8px padding left and right\n- 8px border radius\n\nGo for the specs written above as the video prototype is just to indicate the general interaction patterns. The editable fields to start with should be:\n- Date\n- Merchant\n- Description\n- Category\n- Tag (single-level only)\n- Amount (not currency, only number)\n\ncc @Expensify/design @trjExpensify @JmillsExpensify \n\n\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @ahmedGaber93</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/82534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/82534/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/i