:"https://api.github.com/users/situchan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/situchan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/situchan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/situchan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"dubielzyk-expensify","id":145416827,"node_id":"U_kgDOCKriew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145416827?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify","html_url":"https://github.com/dubielzyk-expensify","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dubielzyk-expensify/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":112,"created_at":"2025-10-13T20:41:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T21:53:26Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"puneetlath","id":1371996,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNzE5OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1371996?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath","html_url":"https://github.com/puneetlath","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/puneetlath/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When you are viewing an expense report, there is a primary action at the top (e.g. Submit, Approve, Pay). That action will apply to the whole expense report, including all the expenses that are a part of it. \n\n<img width=\"2096\" height=\"1326\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ae65596-59a5-438f-9838-0f4aba48ee96\" />\n\nHowever, if you select all the expenses on the report, you don't have the option to Submit/Approve/Pay. \n\n<img width=\"2100\" height=\"1712\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b96e6ae-f557-4140-a70a-f8f6696f9bb4\" />\n\nWe are planning to add the ability to do partial report actions via this select expenses dialog in the future. But that will also require backend changes, since we'll need to move the expenses that weren't included in the action to a separate report. \n\nFor now, when all expenses on a report are selected, let's so show the primary action for the whole report as an option here as well. Since they are selecting all the expenses, we can simply use the same API command that is used for the full report, without needing any backend changes. \n\ncc @garrettmknight \n\nSlack convo: https://expensify.slack.com/archives/C07NMDKEFMH/p1759425792934389\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~021980654523890058082</li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 1980654523890058082</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2025-10-21</li>\n<li>Automatic offers: </li>\n<ul>\n<li>situchan | Contributor | 109266586</li>\n</ul></li>\n    </ul>\n</details>\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @</details>\n\n\n\nEXFY-19660\n\n<details><summary>Issue Owner</summary>Current Issue Owner: @Krishna2323</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/72502/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/72502/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/71913","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/71913/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/71913/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/71913/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/71913","id":3488452597,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7P7Y_1","number":71913,"title":"[Due for payment 2026-07-13] [Partial Payment x 2][Tracking] Deprecation of InteractionManager","user":{"login":"mountiny","id":36083550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDgzNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36083550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny","html_url":"https://github.com/mountiny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mountiny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mou